# .reqqignore — reqQuest Framework validator exclusions (glob per line, "#" for comments).
# Portable across validator implementations — see section 6 of
# https://github.com/reqquest/reqQuestFramework/blob/main/docs/framework/conventions.md
requirements/00-context/**
requirements/metrics/**
requirements/README.md
requirements/**/README.md
# Instructions for AI agents — not requirement artefacts.
requirements/AGENTS.md
requirements/AGENTS.project.md
requirements/CLAUDE.md
# Toolkit version manifest — not a requirement artefact.
# This validator never reaches it (it scans requirements/**/*.md), but the contract targets
# several validator copies, so the exclusion is declared rather than assumed.
.reqq/toolkit.lock
